---
title: Steps 6 and 11 — Edit own booking (user) / any booking (admin)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as User or Admin
    participant P as protect
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant H as Hotel model
    participant B as Booking model

    A->>P: PUT /bookings/:id {checkIn, checkOut}
    alt not logged in
        P-->>A: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>C: updateBooking()
    C->>C: parseStay(): only dates, 1–3 nights, not in the past
    alt invalid stay
        C-->>A: 400 Bad Request
    end
    C->>B: findOne(scope(req))
    Note over C: user: {_id, user: me}<br/>admin: {_id}
    alt another user's booking (user) or not found
        C-->>A: 404 No booking with this id
    end
    alt user edits a paid booking
        C-->>A: 409 A paid booking cannot be changed
    end
    Note over C,B: MongoDB transaction
    C->>H: lock hotel document
    C->>B: count other overlapping bookings
    alt no rooms left for the new dates
        C-->>A: 409 No rooms available
    end
    C->>B: save new checkIn, checkOut
    C-->>A: 200 {data: booking}
